      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَهْرَجٌ</span></b>  <i>Made with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَارُوج</span>, (K,) i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُورَة</span> [or
